Package: cellnetR
Title: R Interface to the CellNet Causal Execution Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CellNet", "Developers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cellnet@example.org")
Author: CellNet Developers [aut, cre]
Maintainer: CellNet Developers <cellnet@example.org>
Description: Compile signed causal networks in R and execute perturbation and
    batch analyses through the CellNet C++ engine. Optional adapters preserve
    source identifiers and provenance metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, methods
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), Matrix, igraph, graph, SummarizedExperiment,
    SingleCellExperiment, OmnipathR, CellNOptR, CARNIVAL, graphite, dorothea,
    decoupleR, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: C++20
Config/testthat/edition: 3
